  "request": "#929 w30 · doctor flags duplicate folder numbers (P3). Add a check to apps/speckit-extension/scripts/doctor_checks.py that lists each numeric prefix under specs/ used by more than one folder, with the folders that share it. Acceptance: Doctor names each duplicated prefix and its folders. Timestamp-named folders are ignored. A clean specs/ gives no finding.\n#929 w43 · Windows-safe output in the status script (P3). In apps/speckit-extension/scripts/status-context.py, make both the summary and the JSON safe for a non-UTF-8 stdout. Acceptance: Running with PYTHONIOENCODING=cp1252 exits 0 and prints valid JSON. The RESOLUTION line still parses. Output on UTF-8 consoles keeps its meaning.\nOwner picked option 2: build the four small P3s (#929 w30, w43; #930 w40, w38) before the release.",
